Measure EE in Loop for All Provided Load Levels
    [Documentation]
    ...  Measure EE in loop for Idle, Low, Medium, Busy, Full load levels.
    ...
    ...  :param str connection: (Mandatory) : Admin connection alias.
    ...  :param list cells: (Optional) : List of specific cells e.g.
    ...                                 ['NRCELL-0', 'NRCELL-1'] if defined as list
    ...                                 or just comma separated string e.g. NRCELL-0,NRCELL-1
    ...                                 If set to None, all cells on the BTS will be used. Default is None.
    ...  :param list rus: (Optional) : List of specific RUs e.g.
    ...                                ['RMOD-1', 'RMOD-2'] if defined as list
    ...                                or just comma separated string e.g. RMOD-1,RMOD-2
    ...                                If set to None, all RUs will be used. Ignored if `cells` is provided. Default is None.
    ...  :param str load_levels: (Optional) : Load levels separated by comma,
    ...                                       default Idle,Low,Medium,Busy,Full.
    ...  :param int measurment_duration: (Optional) : Duration of the test in seconds, default 75 minutes each loop.
    ...  :param int skip_if_tm_not_started_on_lte: (Optional) : If set to True, the test model start failure on LTE will be ignored. Default is False.
    ...
    ...  Behavior based on `cells` and `rus` parameters:
    ...  Case 1: `cells=None` and `rus=None` - The test model will run on all possible cells on the BTS.
    ...  Case 2: `cells=NRCELL-0,NRCELL-1` - The test model will run only on the specified cells. The `rus` parameter is ignored.
    ...  Case 3: `cells=None` and `rus=RMOD-1,RMOD-2` - The test model will run on cells assigned to the specified RUs.
    ...
    ...  Note: The test model will be executed in parallel on all selected cells.
    [Arguments]  ${connection}
    ...          ${cells}=${None}
    ...          ${rus}=${None}
    ...          ${load_levels}=Idle,Low,Medium,Busy,Full
    ...          ${measurment_duration}=4500
    ...          ${skip_if_tm_not_started_on_lte}=${False}
    [Timeout]    24 hours

    ${load_levels}          Evaluate    "${load_levels}".split(',')
    ${detailed_bts_info}    Get Detailed BTS info           connection=${connection}
    ${test_model_params}    Generate Test Model Params      connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     bts_info=${detailed_bts_info["bts_info"]}
    ...                                                     cells=${cells}
    ...                                                     rus=${rus}
    ${cell_dist_names}      Get Cell Dist Names from Test Model Params    ${test_model_params}
    Set Test Variable       ${cell_dist_names}

    ${is_test_model_params_empty}       Evaluate  len(${test_model_params}) == 0
    IF  ${is_test_model_params_empty}
        ${msg}    Catenate              No test model params generated for the provided cells and RUs.
        ...                             Most probbaly the provided cells or RUs do not exist or you pass it in wrong way.
        logger.Log Warn to Console      ${msg}
        Fail                            ${msg}
    END

    logger.Log Info to Console          Executing EE Procedure with the following load levels: ${load_levels}


    FOR    ${load_level}    IN    @{load_levels}
        ${started_dist_names}     Set Variable              ${None}
        logger.Log Info to Console                          START Loop for ${load_level}
        ...                                                 log_hierarchy=2

        Update Test Model Params                            test_model_params=${test_model_params}
        ...                                                 load_level=${load_level}

        Check if BTS in Required State and Change if Needed
        ...                                                 connection=${connection}
        ...                                                 load_level=${load_level}
        ...                                                 cell_dist_names=${cell_dist_names}


        logger.Log Info to Console                          Get EE Counters before
        ...                                                 log_hierarchy=3
        ${counters_before}                                  Wait Until Keyword Succeeds    25x    1 min
        ...                                                 Get EE Counters             connection=${connection}

        IF     '${load_level}' == 'Idle' or '${load_level}' == 'Low'
            logger.Log Info to Console                      Sleep ${measurment_duration} seconds
            ...                                             log_hierarchy=3
            Sleep                                           ${measurment_duration}s
        ELSE
            ${started_dist_names}    Run Parallel Downlink Test Model for Selected Cells
            ...                                             connection=${connection}
            ...                                             test_model_params=${test_model_params}
            ...                                             cell_dist_names=${cell_dist_names}
            ...                                             test_model_duration=${measurment_duration}
            ...                                             skip_if_tm_not_started_on_lte=${skip_if_tm_not_started_on_lte}

        END

        # If only 3 intervals are available, then we should wait until the counters are updated. So far, it has not been necessary to wait
        logger.Log Info to Console                          Get EE Counters after
        ...                                                 log_hierarchy=3
        ${counters_after}    Get EE Counters                connection=${connection}


        ${test_model_params_for_report}    Generate Test Model Params for Report
        ...                                                 load_level=${load_level}
        ...                                                 test_model_params=${test_model_params}
        ...                                                 started_dist_names=${started_dist_names}

        logger.Log Info to Console                          Calculate and Report EE KPI
        ...                                                 log_hierarchy=3
        Report EE KPI                                       ee_counters_before=${counters_before}
        ...                                                 ee_counters_after=${counters_after}
        ...                                                 test_model_params=${test_model_params_for_report}
        ...                                                 detailed_bts_info=${detailed_bts_info}

        logger.Log Info to Console                          END Loop for ${load_level}
    ...                                                     log_hierarchy=2
    END
    logger.Log Info to Console    EE Procedure with the following load levels: ${load_levels} have finished successfully.

Run Parallel Downlink Test Model for Selected Cells
    [Arguments]
    ...          ${connection}
    ...          ${test_model_params}
    ...          ${cell_dist_names}
    ...          ${test_model_duration}=4500
    ...          ${skip_if_tm_not_started_on_lte}=${False}

    [Timeout]    24 hours
    ${started_dist_names}    Create List
    FOR    ${test_model_param}    IN    @{test_model_params}
        logger.Log Info to Console              Executing ${test_model_param["test_model"]} for ${test_model_param["cell_name"]}
        ...                                     log_hierarchy=3
        ${results}    Try to Start Downlink Test Model and Check if Running
        ...                                     connection=${connection}
        ...                                     test_model_param=${test_model_param}
        ...                                     allow_fail_for_lte_tm=${skip_if_tm_not_started_on_lte}
        IF    '${results}' == 'True'
            Append To List    ${started_dist_names}    ${test_model_param["dist_name"]}
        END
    END

    logger.Log Info to Console                   Sleep ${test_model_duration} seconds
    ...                                          log_hierarchy=3
    Sleep                                        ${test_model_duration}s

    logger.Log Info to Console                   Stop all started test models
    ...                                          log_hierarchy=3
    Stop all Active Downlink Test Models
    ...                                          connection=${connection}
    ...                                          cell_dist_names=${started_dist_names}

    RETURN    ${started_dist_names}

    [Teardown]          Stop all Active Downlink Test Models
    ...                                          connection=${connection}
    ...                                          cell_dist_names=${started_dist_names}
